  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Code & Test\r\n\r\nUse AI to turn your flowchart into working code. The AI should create nested `if/else` statements based on your decision diamonds, and each path should display a clear output message.\r\n\r\n----\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Prompt AI Tutor to generate code from your flowchart.  \r\n2. Carefully **check the code** to make sure it matches your logic (don’t assume it’s correct!)\r\n3. Use your test cases table with the \"Student Test Cases\" window to **verify and fix** any issues\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "tutor",
    "predict_settings": {
